- **`StartCoroutine(DelayDestroySelf(0.5f))`** in `OnEnable` — coroutine allocation every time the object is taken from the pool.
- **`OnEnable` raises a `skillQueryChannel` event** every activation — event + struct allocation per shot.
- Many **duplicate `using` statements** and unused usings (`System.Net.Http.Headers`, `System.Runtime.Serialization`, `Unity.VisualScripting`) — code smell, slight compile overhead.
